{"seq":1,"slug":"population","title":"高二地理 — 人口","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/geography/human-geography/population","wordCount":1973,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"高二地理-人口\">高二地理 — 人口</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>世界人口在过去两个世纪经历了前所未有的爆发式增长，从1800年的约10亿增长到2023年的80亿。人口数量变化的背后，是出生率、死亡率与自然增长率三项核心指标的动态博弈。理解人口地理，不仅需要掌握人口增长模型与转变理论，更需要将人口现象放置在具体的区域自然环境与社会经济背景中加以分析。</p>\n<p>核心概念框架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>出生率</td>\n<td>每千人中每年出生的人数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>年出生人数</mtext><mtext>年平均人口</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn><mtext>‰</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CBR = \\frac{\\text{年出生人数}}{\\text{年平均人口}} \\times 1000\\text{‰}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">年平均人口</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">年出生人数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">‰</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死亡率</td>\n<td>每千人中每年死亡的人数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>年死亡人数</mtext><mtext>年平均人口</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn><mtext>‰</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CDR = \\frac{\\text{年死亡人数}}{\\text{年平均人口}} \\times 1000\\text{‰}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">年平均人口</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">年死亡人数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">‰</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然增长率</td>\n<td>人口自然增减速度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NIR = CBR - CDR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总和生育率</td>\n<td>育龄妇女平均生育子女数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TFR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，更替水平约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人口密度</td>\n<td>单位面积的人口数量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = \\frac{P}{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>（人/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-人口增长模式与人口转变\">一、人口增长模式与人口转变</h3><p>人口学家将人口增长划分为四个经典阶段，称为&quot;人口转变模型&quot;（Demographic Transition Model，DTM）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>出生率</th>\n<th>死亡率</th>\n<th>自然增长率</th>\n<th>典型特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一阶段（高-高-低）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极低或波动</td>\n<td>传统农业社会，医疗条件差，粮食不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二阶段（高-降-高）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>快速下降</td>\n<td>迅速升高</td>\n<td>工业化初期，卫生改善，但生育观念未变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三阶段（降-低-降）</td>\n<td>逐步下降</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>由高转低</td>\n<td>城市化加速，教育普及，生育成本上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第四阶段（低-低-低）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>接近零或负</td>\n<td>后工业化社会，老龄化显著</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>中国的人口转变</strong>：中国在20世纪70年代开始推行计划生育政策，使得人口转变速度远快于西方发达国家。中国用约30年完成了欧洲用100年才走完的第二至第三阶段转变。当前中国已进入第四阶段，面临的核心问题是低生育率（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TFR \\approx 1.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span></span></span></span></span>）和快速老龄化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-人口结构与人口金字塔\">二、人口结构与人口金字塔</h3><p>人口结构通常从年龄与性别两个维度加以描述，最直观的工具是<strong>人口金字塔</strong>（Population Pyramid）。</p>\n<p>三种典型形态：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>扩张型（年轻型）</strong>：底宽顶窄，出生率高、人口增长快。如尼日利亚、埃塞俄比亚。</li>\n<li><strong>稳定型（成年型）</strong>：各年龄组比例较均匀，人口增长缓慢。如美国、法国。</li>\n<li><strong>收缩型（老年型）</strong>：底窄顶宽，出生率极低、老龄化严重。如日本、德国。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>老龄化指标</strong>：当65岁及以上人口占比超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7%</span></span></span></span></span> 时，进入老龄化社会；超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14%</span></span></span></span></span> 为深度老龄化；超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>21</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21%</span></span></span></span></span> 为超级老龄化。中国2023年65岁以上人口占比已超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span></span></span></span></span>，正式进入深度老龄化阶段。</p>\n<p><strong>人口抚养比</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>14</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mn>15</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>64</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DR = \\frac{P_{0\\text{-}14} + P_{65+}}{P_{15\\text{-}64}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">64</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">14</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">65</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>抚养比反映劳动年龄人口的负担程度。当抚养比低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span> 时，称为&quot;人口红利&quot;窗口期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-人口迁移\">三、人口迁移</h3><p>人口迁移是指人口跨越一定行政区域、以改变定居地为目的的空间移动。</p>\n<p><strong>推拉理论</strong>（Push-Pull Theory）：迁出地的&quot;推力&quot;（就业不足、自然灾害、战争）与迁入地的&quot;拉力&quot;（经济机会、公共服务、宜居环境）共同驱动人口流动。</p>\n<p>中国人口迁移的历史脉络：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时期</th>\n<th>主要方向</th>\n<th>驱动因素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1949-1978</td>\n<td>城市→农村（知青下乡）、东部→西部</td>\n<td>政策调配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1978-2000</td>\n<td>农村→城市、中西部→东部沿海</td>\n<td>改革开放、工业化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2000至今</td>\n<td>省际流动放缓，城市群内部流动增强</td>\n<td>区域协调发展、产业转移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>国际人口迁移趋势</strong>：全球约有2.8亿国际移民（2023年），主要流向从发展中国家到发达国家。中东石油国（如阿联酋、卡塔尔）外籍人口占比超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>，是典型的劳动力输入型国家。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-人口问题与对策\">四、人口问题与对策</h3><p>不同发展阶段面临不同的人口问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题类型</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>典型国家/地区</th>\n<th>应对措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人口过快增长</td>\n<td>资源紧张、就业困难、贫困</td>\n<td>撒哈拉以南非洲</td>\n<td>发展教育、推广避孕、提高妇女地位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>老龄化加剧</td>\n<td>劳动力不足、养老负担重</td>\n<td>日本、韩国、欧洲</td>\n<td>延迟退休、鼓励生育、接纳移民</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性别比失衡</td>\n<td>婚姻挤压、社会不稳定</td>\n<td>中国、印度</td>\n<td>禁止性别鉴定、改变重男轻女观念</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人口分布不均</td>\n<td>城市拥挤、农村空心化</td>\n<td>大多数发展中国家</td>\n<td>区域均衡发展、新型城镇化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>中国的应对策略</strong>：从&quot;双独二孩&quot;（2011）→&quot;单独二孩&quot;（2013）→&quot;全面二孩&quot;（2016）→&quot;全面三孩&quot;（2021），生育政策不断调整。同时推进延迟退休、完善养老保险体系、发展银发经济。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-人口容量与环境承载力\">五、人口容量与环境承载力</h3><p><strong>环境人口容量</strong>：指在可预见的时期内，利用当地资源和技术条件，在保证基本生活水平的前提下，一个地区所能持续供养的最大人口数量。</p>\n<p>影响因素包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>资源丰富程度（正相关）</li>\n<li>科技发展水平（正相关）</li>\n<li>消费水平（负相关）</li>\n<li>对外开放程度（正相关）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>合理人口容量</strong>（适度人口）：使人均国民收入或生活质量达到最优的人口规模，通常远低于环境人口容量的上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>下图为某国不同年份的人口金字塔。判断该国经历了怎样的人口转变？老龄化趋势如何？</li>\n<li>计算题：某市年初人口500万，全年出生6万人、死亡3.5万人、迁入2万人、迁出1万人。求该市的自然增长率和机械增长率。</li>\n<li>运用推拉理论，分析改革开放后中国农村人口大规模向东部沿海城市迁移的原因。</li>\n<li>比较日本与尼日利亚面临的人口问题差异，并分别提出两条可行的应对建议。</li>\n<li>思考题：有人认为&quot;技术进步可以无限提高环境人口容量&quot;，你是否同意？请从资源、环境、消费三个角度论述。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>联合国《世界人口展望》（World Population Prospects）每两年更新一次全球人口预测数据，是研究人口趋势最权威的来源。</li>\n<li>马尔萨斯《人口原理》提出&quot;人口以几何级数增长，食物以算术级数增长&quot;的经典命题，虽然被绿色革命部分证伪，但资源约束的核心思想仍有启发意义。</li>\n<li>中国第七次全国人口普查（2020年）公报提供了最新、最详尽的中国人口数据，可用于课堂案例分析。</li>\n<li>关注&quot;人口红利&quot;与&quot;人口负债&quot;的转换节点，思考中国经济增长模式如何从劳动密集型向技术密集型转型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>人口地理的核心在于理解人口数量、结构与分布的时空变化规律。人口转变模型揭示了从&quot;高出生率-高死亡率&quot;到&quot;低出生率-低死亡率&quot;的普遍趋势，但不同国家的转变速度与路径各异。人口迁移受经济、政策、环境等多重因素驱动，推拉理论是分析迁移动因的基本框架。面对老龄化、低生育率等现实挑战，需要综合运用人口政策、社会保障与经济转型等手段加以应对。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高二地理 — 人口","id":"高二地理-人口"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、人口增长模式与人口转变","id":"一-人口增长模式与人口转变"},{"level":3,"text":"二、人口结构与人口金字塔","id":"二-人口结构与人口金字塔"},{"level":3,"text":"三、人口迁移","id":"三-人口迁移"},{"level":3,"text":"四、人口问题与对策","id":"四-人口问题与对策"},{"level":3,"text":"五、人口容量与环境承载力","id":"五-人口容量与环境承载力"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"高二地理 — 城市化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/geography/human-geography/urbanization"}}